WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Tyler: ADMIT IT!

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.500
YOU'RE GARBAGE!

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.500
Ethan: YOU'RE THE WORST YOUTUBER IN THE WORLD!

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.600
Mark: NO! IT'S NOT TRUE!

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:07.840
LOOK! IT'S A BUSY WEEK! I DON'T HAVE A LOT OF TIMEE!!!

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.500
Tyler: Excuses, excuses.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.780
Mark: NO! GUYS! NO!

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:11.880
Oh, hey

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.480
Hi, how's it goin'?

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.560
I've got a lot of blood rushing to my head, but uh

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.560
*ding* This week's gonna be really busy because

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.740
We're filming a GREAT big video

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.740
that I'm not gonna tell you exactly what it is

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.140
But this isn't one of those empty promises

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.160
Because it's coming out next week *ding*

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.680
I'm not gonna give too many details about it

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.800
But, since we're working so hard on it this week *ding*

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.300
I'm only gonna be able to get one video out a day this week *ding*

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.060
I'm sorry, it should be back to normal on Saturday

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.620
If we're all finished up by then

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.980
But until then, it's just gonna be one video a day

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.060
I'm so sorry about that-

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.440
I'M SO SORRY GUYS!

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:45.240
(Tyler and Ethan laughing) LET GO OF ME! AHHHH!

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:47.460
Byee!

